ion":"The 100 meters starts the decathlon. The long jump and shot put come later, while the 400 meters closes the first day.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad73-7283-ba0d-60793f7c74fb","description":"100 meters","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad73-7e3e-828a-1dbcef0a176e","description":"Long jump","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad73-7c39-b0bf-bce87144e108","description":"Shot put","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad73-789c-94aa-83a769bb3f2f","description":"400 meters","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad73-728a-aceb-685504902b8c","category":"01a21312-b489-7d12-a39e-857aff280926","question":"With which sport is Margaret Smith Court associated?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Margaret Court is an Australian tennis player who won a record 24 Grand Slam singles titles.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad73-7000-b52c-fd1657ec38e9","description":"Tennis","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad73-7548-9310-4e9af2332874","description":"Rugby union","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad73-7021-820a-3c4043cd8d4d","description":"Volleyball","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad73-7050-aa6c-66ecbe689cb4","description":"Snooker","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad73-7324-bf10-cbe79908f63f","category":"01a21312-b489-7d12-a39e-857aff280926","question":"Who was the first athlete to long jump more than eight metres, in 1935?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Jesse Owens\'s 8.13-metre jump remained the world record for 25 years.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad73-7ae0-9b80-1bb46ae83824","description":"Jesse Owens","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad73-7c18-b51f-6b40787c2b82","description":"Carl Lewis","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad73-7496-be4d-2fd478c91343","description":"Bruce Jenner","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad73-7659-b7dc-4eae2be1a1e9","description":"Bob Beamon","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad73-7764-bddd-fcd15703fefb","category":"01a21312-b489-7d12-a39e-857aff280926","question":"Whi